<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    {{> seo-head}}
  </head>
  <body>
    {{> navbar}}
    <main>
      <section class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="page-header__eyebrow">{{serviceAreaText}}</p>
          <h1 class="page-header__title">About {{companyName}}</h1>
          <p class="page-header__subtitle">
            Your trusted carpet &amp; upholstery steam cleaning specialists in London.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container about-page__grid">
          <div class="about-page__content">
            <p class="section__eyebrow">Our Story</p>
            <h2 class="section__title">Cleaning London Homes, One Room at a Time</h2>
            <p class="section__text">
              Prime Carpet Cleaning and Upholstery Steam Cleaning is a professional carpet
              cleaning company in London that customers can rely on for fresh, clean, and
              well-maintained carpets, rugs, mattresses, and upholstery. We help homeowners,
              landlords, and businesses across London keep their spaces cleaner and more
              comfortable with professional <a href="/#services">cleaning solutions</a>.
            </p>
            <p class="section__text">
              Using professional steam extraction equipment and effective cleaning methods, we
              carefully remove everyday dirt, stains, allergens, and odours from carpets and
              fabrics. From your first free consultation to the final result, we focus on
              clear communication, reliable service, and honest pricing with no hidden fees.
            </p>
            <p class="section__text">
              We proudly provide carpet and <a href="/services/upholstery-sofa-cleaning/">upholstery cleaning services</a> across London, UK,
              offering flexible booking through phone or WhatsApp and free, no-obligation
              quotes to make arranging your cleaning service simple and stress-free.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-page__gallery js-image-carousel">
            {{#each aboutGalleryImages}}
              <img src="{{this.src}}" alt="{{../companyName}} work example" class="carousel__slide {{#if @first}}is-active{{/if}}" loading="lazy" />
            {{/each}}
            <button type="button" class="carousel__arrow carousel__arrow--prev js-carousel-prev" aria-label="Previous image">‹</button>
            <button type="button" class="carousel__arrow carousel__arrow--next js-carousel-next" aria-label="Next image">›</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section about-page__why">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section__header">
            <p class="section__eyebrow">Why Choose Us</p>
            <h2 class="section__title">What Makes Us Different</h2>
            <p class="section__text section__text--wide">
              Choosing the right cleaner is important when inviting someone into your home or
              workplace. As a trusted <a href="/">carpet cleaner in London</a>, we provide a professional, friendly,
              and reliable service from start to finish. Our goal is to deliver quality cleaning
              while making the whole process easy and convenient for every customer.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="services__grid">
            <article class="service-card">
              <span class="service-card__icon">🌿</span>
              <h3 class="service-card__title">Eco-Friendly</h3>
              <p class="service-card__text">We use pet and child-friendly cleaning solutions designed to clean carpets and upholstery effectively while reducing harsh chemical residue.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
              <span class="service-card__icon">💷</span>
              <h3 class="service-card__title">Transparent Pricing</h3>
              <p class="service-card__text">We deliver free, no-obligation quotes with clear pricing, so you know what to expect before the work begins. There are no hidden charges.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
              <span class="service-card__icon">⚡</span>
              <h3 class="service-card__title">Fast &amp; Reliable</h3>
              <p class="service-card__text">We know that your time is valuable. Our flexible scheduling and professional cleaning process help provide a service that fits your routine.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
              <span class="service-card__icon">💬</span>
              <h3 class="service-card__title">Easy Booking</h3>
              <p class="service-card__text">Booking your cleaning service is easy. Contact us by phone, WhatsApp, or our online enquiry form, and our team will arrange your appointment and answer any questions.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section__header">
            <p class="section__eyebrow">Our Services</p>
            <h2 class="section__title">What We Offer</h2>
            <p class="section__text section__text--wide">
              At <a href="/">Prime Carpet Cleaning and Upholstery Steam Cleaning</a>, we provide a range of
              professional cleaning services for homes and businesses across London. Our team
              combines practical experience with professional equipment to deliver effective
              cleaning solutions for different carpets, fabrics, and furnishings.
            </p>
            <p class="section__text section__text--wide">
              Whether you are searching for "carpet cleaning companies near me" or "carpet
              cleaning services in London UK", Prime Carpet Cleaning provides professional
              solutions fit to your needs. Our team of London carpet cleaning experts is
              committed to delivering careful, specialist cleaning for homes and businesses
              throughout the area. Our services include:
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="related-services__grid">
            {{#each services}}
              <a href="/services/{{this.slug}}/" class="related-services__item">{{this.name}} →</a>
            {{/each}}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section cta-section">
        <div class="container cta-section__inner">
          <h2 class="section__title">Ready to Book Your Free Consultation?</h2>
          <p class="section__text section__text--center">Get in touch today for a free, no-obligation quote.</p>
          <div class="hero__actions cta-section__actions">
            <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Get a Free Quote</a>
            <a href="tel:{{contact.phoneHref}}" class="btn btn--outline btn--lg">Call Now</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    {{> footer}}
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
